WEBVTT

NOTE
Dealer call debrief: Fietshuis Utrecht
Date 2026-10-12. Speakers Daan de Vries and Elena Costa.

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
<v Daan de Vries>Thanks for making time, Marloes. Let's go through the order for the autumn window.

2
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Daan de Vries>You mentioned twelve bikes for the store, split between the city centre and the Zuilen branch.

3
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
<v Elena Costa>I want to be clear about delivery. We can give you a firm date once the order is confirmed, not before.

4
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:33.000
<v Daan de Vries>Understood. Your team would like the financing terms for the order too, what are the options?

5
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Daan de Vries>We can offer payment terms of 60 days from delivery on the first order, with the standard credit check.

6
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:48.000
<v Daan de Vries>If your bank prefers a shorter cycle, we can talk about a 30 day option for the second order.

7
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:54.000
<v Elena Costa>The 60 day terms apply to dealers in the first year. After that we review them each quarter.

8
00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:01.000
<v Daan de Vries>On demos: you asked for a demo bike for the weekend of the 24th. I will check the availability this week.

9
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:08.000
<v Daan de Vries>Can you tell me which of your staff will run the test rides? We like to brief them the week before.

10
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:15.000
<v Daan de Vries>Good. I will send a short brief for the team and the demo schedule by Friday.

11
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.000
<v Elena Costa>Please also send the spare parts list for the T1, so the service desk knows what to keep on the shelf.

12
00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:29.000
<v Daan de Vries>Will do. I will copy Elena on the parts list and on the financing confirmation.

13
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:36.000
<v Daan de Vries>Next step is your signature on the order form. The order form is the only thing we need before we book the slot.

14
00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:43.000
<v Daan de Vries>Let us know by the end of the month if the quantity changes, so we can plan the delivery slots.

15
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:50.000
<v Elena Costa>Thanks both. We will confirm the delivery window once the order form is back with us.
